    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Trust the Lord"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, don’t forget my teaching,",
          "but let your heart keep my commands;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for they will bring you",
          "many days, a full life, , and well-being."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Never let loyalty and faithfulness leave you.",
          "Tie them around your neck;",
          "write them on the tablet of your heart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then you will find favor and high regard",
          "with God and people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Trust in the Lord with all your heart,",
          "and do not rely on your own understanding;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "in all your ways know him,",
          "and he will make your paths straight."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t be wise in your own eyes;",
          "fear the Lord and turn away from evil."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This will be healing for your body ,",
          "and strengthening for your bones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Honor the Lord with your possessions",
          "and with the first produce of your entire harvest;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "then your barns will be completely filled,",
          "and your vats will overflow with new wine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not despise the Lord’s instruction, my son,",
          "and do not loathe his discipline;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for the Lord disciplines the one he loves,",
          "just as a father disciplines the son in whom he delights."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom Brings Happiness"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Happy is a man who finds wisdom",
          "and who acquires understanding,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for she is more profitable than silver,",
          "and her revenue is better than gold."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She is more precious than jewels;",
          "nothing you desire can equal her."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Long life is in her right hand;",
          "in her left, riches and honor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Her ways are pleasant,",
          "and all her paths, peaceful."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She is a tree of life to those who embrace her,",
          "and those who hold on to her are happy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord founded the earth by wisdom",
          "and established the heavens by understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "By his knowledge the watery depths broke open,",
          "and the clouds dripped with dew."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Maintain sound wisdom and discretion.",
          "My son, don’t lose sight of them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will be life for you ,",
          "and adornment for your neck."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then you will go safely on your way;",
          "your foot will not stumble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When you lie down, you will not be afraid;",
          "you will lie down, and your sleep will be pleasant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t fear sudden danger",
          "or the ruin of the wicked when it comes,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for the Lord will be your confidence",
          "and will keep your foot from a snare."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Treat Others Fairly"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When it is in your power,",
          "don’t withhold good from the one to whom it belongs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t say to your neighbor, “Go away! Come back later.",
          "I’ll give it tomorrow” #— #when it is there with you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t plan any harm against your neighbor,",
          "for he trusts you and lives near you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t accuse anyone without cause,",
          "when he has done you no harm."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t envy a violent man",
          "or choose any of his ways;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for the devious are detestable to the Lord,",
          "but he is a friend to the upright."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord’s curse is on the household of the wicked,",
          "but he blesses the home of the righteous;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He mocks those who mock",
          "but gives grace to the humble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wise will inherit honor,",
          "but he holds up fools to dishonor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
